      "title": "Meta’s election Community Notes caught politicians — but weren’t always fact checks",
      "url": "https://www.oversightboard.com/decision/pao-007g5zuv",
      "category": "uncategorized",
      "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T20:36:10.810Z",
      "httpStatus": 200,
