      "evidenceText": "Phil Hirschkorn on X: \"Did this \"favor\" happen? Did @SenatorCollins advocate for any Navatek contracts after $8 million Pentagon awarded in Aug. 2019? She says NO. Kao Super PAC donation was 5 months later in Dec. 2019. Where's the proof what Kao alleges is true, @propublica? Please publish if you… / X Post Log in Sign up Post Log in Sign up Phil Hirschkorn on X: \"Did this \"favor\" happen? Did @SenatorCollins advocate for any Navatek contracts after $8 million Pentagon awarded in Aug. 2019? She says NO. Kao Super PAC donation was 5 months later in Dec. 2019. Where's the proof what Kao alleges is true, @propublica? Please publish if you have\" Conversation Phil Hirschkorn @PHirschkorn Did this \"favor\" happen? Did @SenatorCollins advocate for any Navatek contracts after $8 million Pentagon awarded in Aug. 2019? She says NO. Kao Super PAC donation was 5 months later in Dec. 2019. Where's the proof what Kao alleges is true, @propublica ? Please publish if you have ProPublica @propublica Sep 28 The CEO of defense contractor Navatek asked for a favor from Susan Collins via the head of the Collins super PAC. He said if he cut a big check, Navatek wanted Collins to guarantee tens of millions of dollars in additional federal funding. propublica.org/article/fbi-su… 11:54 PM · Sep 28, 2026 · 15K Views 18 7 12 8 Log in or sign up for X See what’s happening and join the conversation Continue with phone Continue with Apple Continue with Google or Log in with username or email Relevant people Phil Hirschkorn @ PHirschkorn Follow Journalist. Host, Political Brew, on News Center Maine. Founder, Real News Productions. Documentary Director. Podcast Producer. Book Writer. What’s happening Show more Phil Hirschkorn @PHirschkorn Did this \"favor\" happen? Did @SenatorCollins advocate for any Navatek contracts after $8 million Pentagon awarded in Aug. 2019? She says NO. Kao Super PAC donation was 5 months later in Dec. 2019. Where's the proof what Kao alleges