      "pageDescription": "🔎 Find Online Profiles Using Just a Face\n\nSometimes you have a photo but no name, username, or other information.\n\nFaceSeek lets you start the investigation with the face itself.\n\nUpload a photo and search for visually similar faces across public sources.\n\n→ Social media\n→ News & blogs\n→ Videos\n→ Other public sources\n\nIt can be useful for investigating fake profiles, impersonation, reused photos, and online identities.\n\n⚠️ But there is an important privacy concern.\n\nBefore uploading a sensitive or private photo, consider whether you are comfortable sharing it with the service and check its current privacy policy and data-retention practices.\n\nI recommend using a face that is already publicly available online whenever possible.\n\n👉 https://faceseek.cc/",
